    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεισ-φρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring in</i> or <i>introduce besides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς ἐπεσφρῶ τήνδε τῷ κείνης λέχει;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
